  "custom_logic_notes": "The EA combines Heiken Ashi candle color (close vs open) for signal direction with Alligator line alignment for trend confirmation. Long entry requires bullish Heiken Ashi candle (close>open) and Alligator lines aligned upward (Lips>Teeth>Jaw). Short entry requires bearish Heiken Ashi candle (close<open) and Alligator lines aligned downward (Lips<Teeth<Jaw). All checks use previous bar (shift=1) values. The EA closes opposite positions before entering new ones. SL/TP values are automatically adjusted by multiplying by 10 for 5-digit brokers (when _Digits==5 or _Point<0.001).",
  "external_dependencies": [],
  "estimated_difficulty": "easy",
  "backtest_data_needs": "M1",
  "python_conversion_notes": "Straightforward conversion. Heiken Ashi values need to be computed manually in Python (HA close = OHLC/4, HA open = (prev HA open + prev HA close)/2). Alligator is standard SMA/SMMA of median price - easily replicated with ta-lib or pandas. All signals use bar[1] (previous completed bar), so no look-ahead bias. SL/TP digit adjustment logic (multiply by 10 for 5-digit) must be replicated. The new bar guard ensures one signal per bar. Position check prevents stacking trades.",
